/*
         Adding a new nullable column PickupUserID int NULL
         Adding a new nullable column PickupNode int NULL

         AccountID column has been changed from "AccountID int NOT NULL" to "int NULL"
         DeliveryDetails column has been changed from "DeliveryDetails char(256) NULL" to "varchar(255) NULL"
         Character length has been change to smaller length.  Truncate the column to new size

 029987  Add column "Secure" to indicate whether an order can be edited/modified by two different process at the same time
 031266  Add columns "PayOnIssuance" and "OrderResolution"
 028678  Add TaxStatus column
 031168  Add TotalDisocunt, TotalPayment, and TotalTax columns
 031465  Add PromotionID, PromotionCode, and SalesCategoryGroupID
         Add ExternalOrderStatus and SalesProgramID
 029444  Add UnformattedExternalID
 041255  Add WebStore only columns: TotalShipping, MerchantID, PromotionOfferID, and SessionID
 041835  Add DeliveryMethodID
 111119  add WebStore only columns: ASPNetSessionID, RemoteAddress, ServerAddress
 */

